tasks.description:
Fix NoteDetailView.jsx - adding a task via handleAddNoteTask doesn't update the UI.

Root cause: handleAddNoteTask calls createTask() then clears input. But linkedTasks list doesn't update after task creation.

SOLUTION: After createTask completes, add a state refresh trigger to force re-render.

```
const handleAddNoteTask = async (e) => {
  e.preventDefault();
  const title = newTaskTitle.trim();
  if (!title) return;
  await createTask({ title, note_id: note.id });
  setNewTaskTitle('');
};
```

Add a refreshKey state that increments after successful task creation:
```
const [linkedTasksRefresh, setLinkedTasksRefresh] = useState(0);
// Then use linkedTasksRefresh in the dependency array of useCallback for loadLinks
```

Acceptance criteria:
- Creating a new task from NoteDetailView shows it immediately in the tasks list
- npm run build passes
